    "desc": "Displays the claim paid amount and the claim billed amount per date. \n•\tPlacing the mouse over this widget will display the total amount paid or billed per date. \n•\tTo view information for a specific date, select the desired line and date on the widget. The widgets will adjust to reflect information for that specific paid/billed amount and date only. The Percent Paid Vs. Percent Billed will also adjust per date. Utilizing filter features will only affect that user’s view.\n•\tUsing the scroll filter below this widget will filter down the widget to specific timeframes. Using the scroll filter feature will only affect this widget.\n•\tTo filter all corresponding widgets by grouped selection, left click and drag across the desired information. Click select. All correlating widgets will adjust.\n•\tTo clear the filter from a widget, select clear selection. To restore the work session dashboard and clear any filters, select the options icon located at the top right corner of the dialog. Select Restore Dashboard.",
